Just so we have a list here of stuff that we're working on, these are the
features we're implementing (not in any particular order):

a)  add servers where account exists to player home page, so you know which
machines are ready for you to log in

b)  the tournament status page, with list of how many (and which) players are
logged onto each server and what player accounts exist

c)  .nethackrc editor

d)  add list of games plaed and trophies won to layer home page

e)  a way to view other player's public info

f)  player profile, so you can put a link to a web site and a message when
other folks view your player

g)  add an "apply to clan" link to player home page

h)  let clan admin set member ranks (since the system already exists for rank

i)  a system for listing and downloading game recorder files

j)  a scoreboard ...  (I found a development copy of the new scoreboard from
last year and 4 trophy definition scripts in my email, so it's a start)

This thread would be a good place for posts requesting other features as well,
if you have any requests.

-robin



